<section class="section">
  <div class="two-col">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">What InvexERP Does</p>
      <h2 class="display reveal">One platform.<br/>Every business <em>function.</em></h2>
      <p class="body-text reveal">InvexERP is an AI-powered enterprise resource planning platform that integrates the core processes most businesses run on disconnected spreadsheets, manual handoffs, or legacy point solutions. Finance, sales, customers, inventory, procurement, HR, payroll, production, logistics — all operating from a single source of truth, with real-time visibility for leadership.</p>
      <div class="svc-list">
        <div class="svc-item reveal "><div class="svc-dot"></div><div><div class="svc-title">Naila AI &middot; Built-In</div><p class="svc-body">InvexERP comes with Naila AI built in &mdash; the platform's automation engine that guides setup, configures workflows, and onboards users in days rather than the months traditional ERP rollouts demand. The implementation cost reduction is the difference between an ERP project that ships and one that stalls.</p></div></div>
        <div class="svc-item reveal d1"><div class="svc-dot"></div><div><div class="svc-title">Real-Time Business Dashboard</div><p class="svc-body">A unified executive dashboard covering live revenue, profit, sales trends, customer balances, top-selling products, and expense versus revenue analysis &mdash; without waiting for end-of-month reports or chasing departments for numbers.</p></div></div>
        <div class="svc-item reveal d2"><div class="svc-dot"></div><div><div class="svc-title">Customisable to Your Operating Model</div><p class="svc-body">Unlike rigid off-the-shelf systems, InvexERP adapts to your business model, workflows, and industry &mdash; not the other way around. We configure it to match how your business actually runs, then train your team to maintain it.</p></div></div>
        <div class="svc-item reveal d0"><div class="svc-dot"></div><div><div class="svc-title">Investment-Ready Data</div><p class="svc-body">Beyond day-to-day operations, InvexERP generates the structured financial and operational data that demonstrates business health &mdash; the kind of data that supports access to bank funding, investor due diligence, and strategic decisions backed by evidence rather than assumption.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
