  <h2 class="display reveal">Full ERP. Single module.<br/>Or <em>integrated with what you have.</em></h2>
  <p class="body-text reveal">Most ERP rollouts fail because they try to do everything at once. InvexERP gives you three deployment approaches &mdash; chosen based on where your business is today, not where the vendor wants you to be.</p>

