      <p class="card-body">Deploy InvexERP as a comprehensive, fully integrated business management platform covering every department from finance to logistics. <em>Right for:</em> medium and larger businesses ready for full-scale automation, or fast-growth SMEs wanting to future-proof from day one.</p>
