      <div class="card-title">B &middot; Single-Module Deployment</div>
      <p class="card-body">Don't need the full ERP yet? Pick one module that solves your most painful operational problem &mdash; HR &amp; Payroll, Inventory, Invoicing, or Procurement &mdash; deployed as a standalone solution. <em>Right for:</em> SMEs automating one process at a time, with a clear upgrade path to the full platform later.</p>
